ED /x1 ED x1 y1 /x1 x0 x1 add 2 div def /y1 y0 y1 add 2 div def x1 y1
moveto /n n 2 sub def n { Lineto } repeat x1 y1 x0 y0 6 4 roll Lineto
Lineto pop pop closepath } ifelse } def
